        <p>MEDICAL.</p>
        <p>A CARD. pEVEEF.ND JOSEPH HOLMES' improvPd !Lt, NreXiCarl Prescription, as discovered in the hot table lends of Old Mexico. is a guaranteed cure to all those wh toffee from the errors and indiscretions of youth, neivous phvaical exhaustion, and early decay. To intro dime it, into tegland, the Mexican Prescription will be sent lree, of charge. upon receipt of a self addressed stamped envelope. Only address : JOSEPH HOLIAEi. Remedy Co.. Bioemsboev MansionS, Bloomsbury-square, London, W.C. nention titi3 paper.</p>
