      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-11-04_WidnesExaminer_art0049" n="art0049">
        <head>EXTENSIVE ALTERATION AND IMPROVEMENT OF PREMISES.</head>
        <p>EXTENSIVE ALTERATION AND IMPROVEMENT OF PREMISES.</p>
