        <head>FOOTBALL.</head>
        <p>FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>Secretaries of Football Clubs are requested to note that reports of matches played on Saturday must be sent to the head office, Bewsey-street. Warrington, not later than ten o'clock on Wednesday morning.</p>
        <p>GEORGB G. BUSSRY and Co. are leading makers of Footballs. Hockey. Golf, and requisites for Sports. Games. and Gymnasia. Catalogue may be had on application to the Sports Manufactory, Peckham, London, S.M. BEST 4ec-eok BRAND.</p>
