        <p>Open to all members of F and U C Vs, 7 rounds at 200, 500 and 60 yards. Sergeant W H Harvey, £3, 91; Sergeant B Edwards, £2 12s 63, 90; Private S Joinson, 162 55 , 78 ; Ser- geant J A Rushton, £1 17s 6il, 76 ; Lance-Sergeant W D Cooper, £1 10s, 71; Colour-Sergeant J Mart, £1 be, 70; Ser- geant G R Joynson, £l, 66; Lance-Corporal G Littlemoro, 17s 6d. 64; Colour-Sergeant J Poole, 15s. 63 • Private W Broady. 12s 61, 62 ; Lance-Corpar d W Nieki, 12s 61, 62 ; Lance-Corporal J Gittens, 12s 6d, 61 Private S Thompson. 105, 59; Corporal W F Gaskell, 10s, 53 ; Corporal J. Marsh, 10s, 57; Sergeant T Holmes, 7s 61, 57; Private It Shaw, 7s 63, 55 ; Private C Glover. 53. 55; Private J Houghton, 53, 54;lance-Sergeant G Lee, ss, 52; Lance-Corporal G Oultram, be, 49'; Private R Foulkes, ss, 48 ; Sergeant J W Woodland, 55, 45; Private E Burst, ss, 42; Corporal Wlt Pheonix, 55, 38; Private C Temple, 53, 33; Private J Hitchen, be, 37 Corporal P Turner, ss, 36; Corporal W Walker. 53, 34; Priv- ate 1V Forster. ss, 31.</p>
